---
import { commentPageKey } from "../../utils/comment-path";
import { siteConfig } from "../../config/site";
import "../../styles/fonts.generated.css";
const target = commentPageKey(Astro.url.pathname);
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={new URL(target, siteConfig.site)} />
    <title>正在前往评论</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>此页面已迁移，<a href={target}>继续访问对应页面</a>。</p>
    <script define:vars={{ target }} data-astro-rerun>
      // 静态 meta refresh 会丢失 hash；旧邮件中的评论定位信息必须原样带到新页。
      location.replace(target + location.search + location.hash);
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  body { font-family: "MiSans Subset", "MiSans", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; }
</style>
